{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And it consumed them</b> — אותם in gematria is זה הנפש. אותם is plene with vav; they sinned in six things: strange fire; they ruled in the presence of their master; intoxicated with wine; they had no children; they set their eyes on sustenance; they did not take counsel."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:19:04.163332828Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}